<!--
    AartistLogo – the AARTist wordmark that folds into its first "A" and back (look lives here, motion in AartistLogo.xaml.cs).
    Nothing is wiped away: the T slides under the R, the R under the second A, that A under the first one. Every edge
    something disappears behind is the real outline of the letter in front of it, so no mask line is ever visible.
    The artwork is one traced path (656 × 90 units). Each letter is that same path seen through a clip region, and the
    layers are nested, so a letter that slides takes everything to its right along:
        first A (on top)  ›  second A  ›  R  ›  T + speed line  ›  i, s, t
    Colours and lights are the aurora from GlowSweep.xaml; letters only take colour while they travel.
-->
